---
// Author, import, bind and run: the life of a package from Git to a running workspace.
---

<div class="ps-flow ps-wide not-content" data-reveal="children">
	<div class="ps-flow-step">
		<svg class="ps-flow-art" viewBox="0 0 220 72" aria-hidden="true">
			<rect class="f-file" x="16" y="14" width="78" height="9" rx="2"></rect>
			<rect class="f-file" x="16" y="31" width="62" height="9" rx="2"></rect>
			<rect class="f-file" x="16" y="48" width="70" height="9" rx="2"></rect>
			<path class="f-line" d="M124 36 H196"></path>
			<circle class="f-dot" cx="124" cy="36" r="5"></circle>
			<circle class="f-dot" cx="160" cy="36" r="5"></circle>
			<circle class="f-dot on pop" cx="196" cy="36" r="6"></circle>
			<text x="160" y="58" text-anchor="middle">commits</text>
		</svg>
		<h3><span>1</span>Author</h3>
		<p>Definitions live in Git. Each linked definition has a stable resource key, and publishing records its fingerprint and revision in the registry.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="ps-flow-link" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="ps-flow-step">
		<svg class="ps-flow-art" viewBox="0 0 220 72" aria-hidden="true">
			<rect class="f-file" x="16" y="20" width="70" height="12" rx="3"></rect>
			<rect class="f-file" x="16" y="40" width="70" height="12" rx="3"></rect>
			<text x="51" y="66" text-anchor="middle">recorded · computed</text>
			<path class="f-line" d="M98 26 H124 M98 46 H124"></path>
			<g class="pop">
				<circle class="f-accent" cx="150" cy="36" r="15"></circle>
				<path class="f-ok" d="M143 36.5 l5 5 l9 -10.5"></path>
			</g>
			<text x="150" y="66" text-anchor="middle">match</text>
		</svg>
		<h3><span>2</span>Import</h3>
		<p>A runtime reads the registry, checks each fingerprint and creates the lists, pipelines and workflows the package declares.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="ps-flow-link" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="ps-flow-step">
		<svg class="ps-flow-art" viewBox="0 0 220 72" aria-hidden="true">
			<g class="pop" style="--i:0">
				<rect class="f-accent" x="14" y="24" width="56" height="24" rx="6"></rect>
				<text x="42" y="39" text-anchor="middle">model</text>
			</g>
			<g class="pop" style="--i:1">
				<rect class="f-accent" x="82" y="24" width="56" height="24" rx="6"></rect>
				<text x="110" y="39" text-anchor="middle">accounts</text>
			</g>
			<g class="pop" style="--i:2">
				<rect class="f-accent" x="150" y="24" width="56" height="24" rx="6"></rect>
				<text x="178" y="39" text-anchor="middle">people</text>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<h3><span>3</span>Bind and run</h3>
		<p>The workspace chooses the model, connects accounts and assigns people. The runtime reports what it can execute and blocks anything it cannot do safely.</p>
	</div>
</div>

<script>
	import '../scripts/reveal.ts';
</script>
